options.description:
Path to a local file containing the body of JSON request.
+
An example of a JSON request:
+
    {
      "instances": [
        {"x": [1, 2], "y": [3, 4]},
        {"x": [-1, -2], "y": [-3, -4]}
      ]
    }
+
This flag accepts "-" for stdin

